@@ -1,5 +1,17 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Availability endpoint: `GET /bookings/availability` reports the free slots of
+  a room inside a window, so a client no longer has to guess a free time.
+- Conflict detection now covers any overlap, not only the start of the new
+  booking, and also runs when a booking is rescheduled.
+- Booking window rules enforced on create and update: end after start, duration
+  between 30 minutes and 8 hours, start in the future.
+- A booking that points at a room or a user that does not exist answers 404
+  instead of 500.
+- A conflict response carries `nextAvailableStart` in its details.
+
 ## 1.0.0
 
 - Rooms, users, bookings and amenities endpoints.
